  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "k0001",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We believe in a collaborative community, and Agency Field Day is a day of fun and friendly competition that drives that value. We always have such a blast at Agency Field Day that we decided to bring it back this year on June 16th!",
          "_key": "k0002"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0003",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Last year, teams from O3 World, BlueCadet, Inverse Paradox, Slice Communications and Tonic Design Co. faced off in events.",
          "_key": "k0004"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0005",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This year, we are excited to have Blue Cadet and Inverse Paradox to join us again for another day of fun, and to have new team additions: Hanlon Creative and Seer Interactive.",
          "_key": "k0006"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0007",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Be sure to catch up on the action on June 16th by using the hashtag ",
          "_key": "k0008"
        },
        {
